### get userinfo with auth_token
GET {{ WLS_AUTH_SERVICE }}/user
Authorization: Bearer {{$auth.token("auth-service")}}

### Import Wahltermindaten - works only with profile "dummy.clients" | user wls_all_uwb + wls_all_bwb
POST {{ WLS_ADMIN_SERVICE_URL }}/businessActions/importWahltermindaten/827e9e6a-ebe9-483f-a9cd-162b26f348e8
Authorization: Bearer {{$auth.token("auth-service")}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Delete Wahltermindaten (needs profile 'dummy.clients' to make this work because of internal calls to other services) | user wls_all_uwb + wls_all_bwb
POST {{ WLS_ADMIN_SERVICE_URL }}/businessActions/deleteWahltermindaten/827e9e6a-ebe9-483f-a9cd-162b26f348e8
Authorization: Bearer {{$auth.token("auth-service")}}
Content-Type: application/json